OL,3,AColombian police storm supermarket to  
OL,4,Afree 20 held hostage for 17 hours      
OL,6,FWith the situation becoming ever more  
OL,7,Fintense as the day progressed, De la   
OL,8,FEspriella gave the green light for     
OL,9,Fspecial forces and police to launch a  
OL,10,Fdaring operation to free the hostages, 
OL,11,Fin which one gunman was killed.        
